                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJJzatMBivQjQRnMZcK994nNw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0NlZHMW5TbWwxU0hGMVZWaE9NVGxTT1ZoWExWRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I originally planned to eat at a nearby brunch place, but it was too crowded… I unexpectedly stumbled upon this pasta shop, and it was surprisingly delicious! 😋❤️\n\nThe shop is small, with limited seating. It\u0027s run by a man and a woman; the man cooks the pasta, and the woman prepares desserts and drinks. There\u0027s also an adorable orange tabby cat! 😍\n\nBolognese Pasta 🍝: The tomato sauce is very rich and sweet! It also has diced tomatoes and minced meat, paired with spices—delicious! 😋\n\nCarbonara Pasta 🍝: Cream, cheese, and Italian bacon—not too greasy, thanks to the black pepper! ❤️\n\nThe latte was also smooth, with plenty of milk foam.\n\nI\u0027ll definitely come again! ❤️",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "本來想去吃附近的早午餐店，結果人太多…意外來到這家義大利麵店，結果出乎意料的好吃😋❤️\n\n店面小小的，座位也不多，一男一女的老闆，男生負責煮義大利麵，女生負責甜點飲料。還有一隻可愛的橘貓！😍\n\n肉醬義大利麵🍝：番茄醬汁非常濃郁、很鮮甜！還有蕃茄丁和肉末，搭配辛香料，好吃😋\n\ncarbonara義大利麵🍝：奶油+奶酪+義式培根，不會太膩口，因為有黑胡椒輔佐❤️\n\n拿鐵也很順口，奶泡很多。\n下次還會再來❤️",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Ivy Chiu",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114009267428061005156/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0LLC5qXj1trlVEzgJgCjqhntBfHQKP_9vt-TtF2gPiNijHFA4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2026-02-04T12:08:41.327789931Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0NlZHMW5TbWwxU0hGMVZWaE9NVGxTT1ZoWExWRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0NlZHMW5TbWwxU0hGMVZWaE9NVGxTT1ZoWExWRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442af1830ad3627:0xdc9c78df2b5cc69c"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJJzatMBivQjQRnMZcK994nNw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ZelRIaFJRMUJuUjBGa09IQkRjakJNYkVFdFkzYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "2 months ago",
                        "rating":  3,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "假日晚間，店內環境怡人，佈置不錯\n能看到廚師很用心的在做餐\n• 店貓很可愛，雖然會看著你吃，但不會過來分一杯羹；貓咪雖然會睡桌上，但環境很乾淨\n• 乳酪燻肉堅果拼盤不錯吃，各式乳酪吃多了有點鹹，但康門貝爾上有淋蜂蜜，配起來味道就不會太單一了\n• 松露薯條份量很大，菜單介紹有松露醬，可惜實際上面沒有，就純薯條而已\n當下看到有驚訝，但想說現場顧客很少，應該是沒有出錯餐\n• 有提供簡單打包的服務\n考慮要不要再來試試其他主食及點心",
                                     "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
