                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJJzatMBivQjQRnMZcK994nNw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGQ1F6RTVlVzFQU201c2FXaGZWMnB0WTNKQ1NsRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "2 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Although there aren\u0027t many seats, it\u0027s very comfortable. The shady trees along Jiantan Road are perfect for a stroll, and the Taipei Performing Arts Center, a unique landmark, adds to the international charm of the Shilin area. I also discovered this charming little bar; the anchovy pasta and handmade burger patties, along with the recommended baijiu (Chinese liquor), are all excellent. And this little orange cat is just too cute…",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "雖然位子少，但很舒服。劍潭路的綠蔭適合散步，台北藝術表演中心這特殊地標建築，讓士林這一帶更具有國際城市的魅力。又多發現這親切的小酒館，鯷魚義大利麵及手工漢堡肉，還有推薦白酒都好極吃。還有這小橘貓真的太可愛了……。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
